notes.content:
This patch addresses the following issues:

- Dodge rate of the boss "Mistform" slightly decreased;
- Fixed a bug where achievements do not unlock on Linux;
- [Linux] Survival Mode bosses attacking during player's turn;
- [Linux] 'Godslayer' achievement not unlocking;
- [Linux] Elf Ranger's 'Magic Imbue' count not displaying properly.

This patch addresses the following issues:

